1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:04,600
Your app works on your phone

2
00:00:05,400 --> 00:00:06,858
But your users have

3
00:00:06,858 --> 00:00:08,200
every other phone

4
00:00:08,400 --> 00:00:09,917
And a bug report never shows

5
00:00:09,917 --> 00:00:11,300
the moment they got stuck

6
00:00:11,900 --> 00:00:14,558
Pocket QA is a usability lab

7
00:00:14,558 --> 00:00:16,200
in every pocket

8
00:00:16,900 --> 00:00:18,759
Builders set the tasks

9
00:00:18,759 --> 00:00:20,551
the devices they need

10
00:00:20,551 --> 00:00:22,941
and a reward for approved work

11
00:00:22,941 --> 00:00:24,800
then publish the study

12
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:28,151
Here it is on a Solana Seeker

13
00:00:28,151 --> 00:00:29,600
from our Android APK

14
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:31,354
Testers link a devnet wallet

15
00:00:31,354 --> 00:00:32,954
through Mobile Wallet Adapter

16
00:00:32,954 --> 00:00:34,600
then save their device profile

17
00:00:34,800 --> 00:00:37,040
They pick a matching study

18
00:00:37,040 --> 00:00:38,230
and consent

19
00:00:38,230 --> 00:00:40,400
Every session, every time

20
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:42,552
They do the tasks

21
00:00:42,552 --> 00:00:43,804
record the screen

22
00:00:43,804 --> 00:00:45,600
and say what got in the way

23
00:00:45,800 --> 00:00:47,612
Nothing uploads

24
00:00:47,612 --> 00:00:50,200
until they’ve checked it

25
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:53,001
Builders watch what really happened

26
00:00:53,001 --> 00:00:55,000
and write the findings themselves

27
00:00:55,100 --> 00:00:56,594
then approve

28
00:00:56,594 --> 00:00:59,000
or reject with a reason

29
00:00:59,700 --> 00:01:01,861
Once approved, the reward lands

30
00:01:01,861 --> 00:01:04,140
in the tester’s simulated balance

31
00:01:04,140 --> 00:01:05,600
No real money moves

32
00:01:06,500 --> 00:01:07,962
Separately, the escrow

33
00:01:07,962 --> 00:01:09,320
was tested on devnet

34
00:01:09,320 --> 00:01:11,200
a two-of-three vault per study

35
00:01:11,300 --> 00:01:13,258
Funding, payouts, fees and refunds

36
00:01:13,258 --> 00:01:14,140
all verified

37
00:01:14,140 --> 00:01:16,000
Devnet tokens have no cash value

38
00:01:16,700 --> 00:01:19,757
Good work builds a reputation

39
00:01:19,757 --> 00:01:21,766
ranked by quality

40
00:01:21,766 --> 00:01:23,600
never by volume

41
00:01:24,300 --> 00:01:26,934
It’s built and tested end to end

42
00:01:26,934 --> 00:01:29,360
with a completed escrow pilot

43
00:01:29,360 --> 00:01:30,400
on devnet

44
00:01:31,100 --> 00:01:32,094
Pocket QA

45
00:01:32,094 --> 00:01:34,083
Real phones, real people

46
00:01:34,083 --> 00:01:35,342
real findings

47
